  "description": "Min Deul-Le graduated art college and dreams of becoming an artist. However, six months after graduation, he applies for a job as a trainee at a company. His status as \"trainee\", rather than \"intern\" or \"temp\", makes him aware of the grim reality of his situation.\n\n(Source: Manhwakyung, translated) \n\n*Note: The main character's name, Min Deul-Le (민들레), means \"dandelion\".*",
